# vehje-check. graded check pass

The framework's graded check pass (the crate directory renames from
`vehje-typecheck` to `vehje-check` in this round). It discharges the graded
(co)modal judgment over the resolved Core IR: effect inference (a
thermometer-encoded bitmask join), lease and reachability inference (a coeffect
fixpoint with the binder rule), binding-time discharge, and assurance grading,
then checks inclusion against a target and mints the `Checked` witness. The
reachability and effect inference are fixpoint queries on `vehje-fixpoint`; the
lease-rule schema comes from `vehje-signature`. Where the type-system-as-
verification identity lives. `#![no_std]`, no alloc.
